flowchart TD
  browser[Browser client]
  aiclients[AI clients]
  cli[CLI]
  repl[Interactive REPL]
  gui[GUI server]
  mcp[MCP server]
  router[Tool router]
  runners[AI runners]
  commands[Command modules]
  engine[CodeSearchIndex engine]
  store[(On-disk index)]
  llm[LLM engines]

  browser -->|calls api routes| gui
  aiclients -->|speaks MCP over stdio| mcp
  cli -->|if-chain dispatch| commands
  cli -->|build and inline commands| engine
  repl -->|same do handlers| commands
  gui -->|route handlers| engine
  gui -->|exec route and shared helpers| commands
  mcp -->|handleTool| router
  router -->|query the index| engine
  commands -->|query the index| engine
  cli -->|ask-ai and Overview by AI| runners
  gui -->|Chat and Overview by AI| runners
  runners -->|tool calls in-process| router
  runners -->|model calls| llm
  commands -->|analyze and claim drafting| llm
  gui -->|its own model calls| llm
  engine -->|builds saves loads| store

%% tip: Tool router :: The TOOLS table and handleTool. Used by external MCP clients and, in-process, by CodeExam itself.
%% tip: AI runners :: Chat loops, Overview by AI, and the LLM runner. Several paths, not one.
%% tip: LLM engines :: Optional. Reached from three places, each guarded under --air-gapped.
%% tip: CodeSearchIndex engine :: The one engine all four front-ends share.
%% tip: On-disk index :: A directory of plain JSON files, or a .zip holding one.
